  "short_description": "<p>Handwoven seagrass storage basket crafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans. Durable, lightweight, and eco-friendly — perfect for organizing living rooms, bathrooms, closets, and retail spaces. Available in multiple sizes with customizable designs, handles, and colors. Ideal for wholesalers, retailers, hotels, and home décor brands.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"789\">The <strong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"456\">Seagrass Storage Basket</strong> is one of Vietcraft’s best-selling natural home décor products, handcrafted by skilled artisans in the coastal regions of Vietnam. Made from 100% natural seagrass, each basket is tightly woven to create a strong, lightweight, and eco-friendly storage solution suitable for homes, resorts, retail stores, and interior décor projects.</p>\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"1142\">Seagrass is a durable natural fiber known for its warm, organic texture and pleasant natural scent. The baskets bring a simple yet elegant charm to any living space, making them perfect for both modern and rustic interior styles. With multiple sizes and shapes available, our seagrass storage baskets are ideal for organizing every corner of the home.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1147\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1168\"><strong data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1168\">Key Features</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1671\">\n<li data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1231\">\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1231\"><strong data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1206\">Handwoven from natural seagrass</strong> by Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1284\">\n<p data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1284\"><strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1282\">Eco-friendly, sustainable, and biodegradable</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1332\">\n<p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1332\"><strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1313\">Strong yet lightweight</strong> for everyday use</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1388\">\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1388\"><strong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1360\">Warm, natural texture</strong> adds beauty to home décor</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1458\">\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1458\"><strong data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1427\">Various shapes &amp; sizes available</strong> – round, square, rectangular</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1522\">\n<p data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1522\"><strong data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1520\">Optional cotton lining, lids, handles, labels, and tags</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1609\">\n<p data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1609\"><strong data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1607\">Perfect for B2B wholesale, retail chains, interior brands, hotels, and resorts</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1671\">\n<p data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1671\"><strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1628\">Customizable</strong>: size, color, weaving pattern, and packing</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1676\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1697\"><strong data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1697\">Popular Uses</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1962\">\n<li data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1732\">\n<p data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1732\">Closet &amp; wardrobe organization</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1779\">\n<p data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1779\">Bathroom storage for towels and toiletries</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1799\">\n<p data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1799\">Laundry baskets</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1831\">\n<p data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1831\">Toy storage for kids’ rooms</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1867\">\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1867\">Kitchen and pantry organization</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1889\">\n<p data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1889\">Living room décor</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1925\">\n<p data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1925\">Hotel &amp; resort room accessories</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1962\">\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1962\">Retail displays and gift packaging</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1967\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2006\"><strong data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2006\">Available Sizes (Customizable)</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2132\">\n<li data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2026\">\n<p data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2026\">Small: 20–25 cm</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2047\">\n<p data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2047\">Medium: 30–35 cm</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2132\">\n<p data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2132\">Large: 40–50 cm<br data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2068\" />(Height and width adjustable according to customer requirements)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2205\">We accept <strong data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2179\">OEM design and private labeling</strong> for international buyers.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2210\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2241\"><strong data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2241\">Production Information</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2526\">\n<li data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2277\">\n<p data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2277\">Material: 100% natural seagrass</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2336\">\n<p data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2336\">Handmade in: Thai Binh, Ninh Binh, Thanh Hóa (Vietnam)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2375\">\n<p data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2375\">MOQ: 200–500 pcs depending on size</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2401\">\n<p data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2401\">Lead Time: 30–45 days</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2469\">\n<p data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2469\">Packing: Standard export carton, mail-order packaging available</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2526\">\n<p data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2526\">Quality: Export-standard for EU, US, and Japan markets</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2531\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2561\"><strong data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2561\">Why Choose Vietcraft?</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2806\">Vietcraft is a leading exporter of handcrafted home décor made from natural and recycled materials such as seagrass, water hyacinth, rattan, bamboo, and more. With over 18 years of experience serving importers in Europe and America, we provide:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2957\">\n<li data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2826\">\n<p data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2826\">Stable quality</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2860\">\n<p data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2860\">Competitive wholesale pricing</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2891\">\n<p data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2891\">Strong production capacity</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2915\">\n<p data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2915\">Reliable lead times</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2957\">\n<p data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2957\">Custom designs for brands &amp; retailers</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"3107\">Our seagrass storage baskets combine traditional craftsmanship with modern design, offering a beautiful, sustainable solution for home organization.</p>",
